WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,460 --> 00:00:11,020
Akala ko ba bookshop ito?

2
00:00:11,020 --> 00:00:26,460
Ang gulo-gulo naman ng setup na ito

3
00:00:26,460 --> 00:00:28,460
Ikaw ang gusto mong makita nang personal

4
00:00:28,460 --> 00:00:30,000
Anong oras na?

5
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:33,500
Hindi pa namin nakikita anino ni Young Master Xu, Inay

6
00:00:33,500 --> 00:00:35,500
Buhay ang pinag-uusapan dito

7
00:00:35,500 --> 00:00:37,910
Kailangan kong pumili nang mabuti

8
00:00:37,910 --> 00:00:39,410
Eighteen ka na at nagpipili ka pa?

9
00:00:39,410 --> 00:00:40,710
Ilang beses na ba ito?

10
00:00:40,710 --> 00:00:42,410
Una — masyadong maliit, sabi mo

11
00:00:42,410 --> 00:00:46,550
Pangalawa — parang kawayan, sabi ni Nanny Zhou

12
00:00:46,550 --> 00:00:48,050
Halika, tingnan natin sa baba

13
00:00:48,050 --> 00:00:49,150
Bakit wala pa si Matchmaker Wang?

14
00:00:49,150 --> 00:00:50,350
Uy, dito ka muna

15
00:00:50,350 --> 00:00:58,530
Huwag kang lalayo, Young Lord

16
00:00:58,530 --> 00:00:59,770
Nagdaos si Madam ng Autumn Banquet

17
00:00:59,770 --> 00:01:01,270
para sa iyong matchmaking

18
00:01:01,270 --> 00:01:02,670
Kaya nagtago tayo dito sa Yundu Tavern

19
00:01:02,670 --> 00:01:05,130
Sa wakas, tahimik. Halika na

20
00:01:05,130 --> 00:01:06,130
Ikaw ang magbantay sa labas

21
00:01:06,130 --> 00:01:32,140
Ito na ang aking kapalaran

22
00:01:32,140 --> 00:01:34,140
Young Master Xu? Ako si Song Yu

23
00:01:34,140 --> 00:01:35,640
ang Yu na ninanais ngunit hindi makamtan

24
00:01:35,640 --> 00:01:39,380
Maling silid ang pasok mo, iha

25
00:01:39,380 --> 00:01:40,380
Hindi ako si—

26
00:01:40,380 --> 00:01:43,210
Ang ganda pa ng pananalita mo

27
00:01:44,070 --> 00:01:46,810
Sabi ni Matchmaker Wang ang mga kondisyon ko na, di ba? Umupo ka

28
00:01:46,810 --> 00:01:48,720
Nakakapagod namang nakatayo

29
00:01:48,720 --> 00:01:52,920
Akala niya ako ang kanyang date — ayos lang

30
00:01:52,960 --> 00:01:55,160
para tumigil si Inay sa kakulit na ipakasal ako

31
00:01:55,160 --> 00:01:56,360
Kung bagay siya

32
00:01:56,360 --> 00:01:58,380
edi sasamahan ko na lang

33
00:01:58,380 --> 00:01:59,380
Anong mga kondisyon?
